WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.441 --> 00:00:03.731
Unit eleven. Digital Storytelling!

2
00:00:04.627 --> 00:00:09.617
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:13.366
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.416 --> 00:00:17.778
Today we learn about Digital Storytelling. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.065 --> 00:00:23.765
Digital story. Say it with me. Digital story!

6
00:00:27.295 --> 00:00:31.562
Narrative. Say it with me. Narrative!

7
00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:38.991
Slide. Say it with me. Slide!

8
00:00:42.513 --> 00:00:46.402
Image. Say it with me. Image!

9
00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:54.483
Voice recording. Say it with me. Voice recording!

10
00:00:57.964 --> 00:01:01.998
Sequence. Say it with me. Sequence!

11
00:01:05.527 --> 00:01:09.416
Create. Say it with me. Create!

12
00:01:12.871 --> 00:01:16.475
Share. Say it with me. Share!

13
00:01:19.998 --> 00:01:28.726
Digital storytelling combines a narrative with an image and a slide in sequence. I can add a voice recording and share my story.

14
00:01:28.776 --> 00:01:32.035
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:32.783 --> 00:01:38.275
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:38.325 --> 00:01:39.475
Slide!

17
00:01:40.584 --> 00:01:45.968
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:46.018 --> 00:01:47.168
Create!

19
00:01:48.146 --> 00:01:56.086
Did you know? Digital storytelling lets you combine pictures, voice, and text together in ways a plain book cannot!

20
00:01:56.136 --> 00:01:58.463
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:59.469 --> 00:02:09.387
Think and answer. What story would you like to tell using digital storytelling tools?

22
00:02:09.437 --> 00:02:10.588
Great answer!

23
00:02:11.674 --> 00:02:17.810
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:20.884
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

